  1→/**
  2→ * Iteration 6: Combined Optimizations (Final)
  3→ * 
  4→ * Combines all optimizations:
  5→ * - Fused quant+GEMM
  6→ * - 8-wave ping-pong
  7→ * - LDS swizzle XOR
  8→ * - Direct global→LDS (128-bit)
  9→ * - MFMA tile tuning
 10→ * - Instruction scheduling (sched_barrier, s_setprio)
 11→ * 
 12→ * Target: 9.7 µs (leader: 9.671 µs)
 13→ */
